%% =============================================================================
%% WASAC Utility Billing — End-to-end billing sequence (happy path)
%% =============================================================================

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    actor Operator
    actor Finance
    actor Customer
    participant API as REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Admin,DB: Setup (once per customer)
    Admin->>API: Register customer (+ optional userId link)
    Admin->>API: Attach meter to customer
    Admin->>API: Create tariff (FLAT or TIERED)

    Note over Operator,DB: Monthly operations
    Operator->>API: Capture meter reading
    API->>DB: Save reading

    Admin->>API: Generate bill for meter + period
    API->>DB: Insert bill (PENDING)
    DB-->>DB: Trigger: bill notification

    Finance->>API: Approve bill
    API->>DB: Update status → APPROVED

    Finance->>API: Record payment (partial or full)
    API->>DB: Insert payment, reduce balance
    alt Balance = 0
        DB-->>DB: Trigger: bill → PAID + payment notification
    end

    Customer->>API: View bills, payments, notifications
    Customer->>API: Mark notification as read
